      },
      "content": {
        "label": "",
        "heading": "Rethink AI",
        "body": "The barrier between an idea and a working product has never been lower.",
        "source": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-2",
      "name": "The opposition",
      "space": {
        "x": 44,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 80,
        "height": 82,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "THE OPPOSITION",
        "heading": "Is AI Making Us Think Less?",
        "body": "• Academic dishonesty\n• Cognitive dependence\n• Loss of critical thinking",
        "source": "Bastani et al. (2025), PNAS; UNESCO (2023)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-3",
      "name": "The counterargument",
      "space": {
        "x": 56,
        "y": 49,
        "width": 80,
        "height": 76,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "THE COUNTERARGUMENT",
        "heading": "Using AI ≠ Creating With AI",
        "body": "Don't outsource your thinking. Outsource the barriers.",
        "source": "Y Combinator (2025); UNESCO (2023)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-4",
      "name": "The proof",
      "space": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": 51,
        "width": 86,
        "height": 86,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "THE PROOF",
        "heading": "This Presentation Was Built With AI",
        "body": "Not PowerPoint. Not Google Slides.\n\nCode. Creativity. Collaboration.",
        "source": "Peng et al. (2023), The Impact of AI on Developer Productivity"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-5",
      "name": "Entrepreneurship",
      "space": {
        "x": 46,
        "y": 49,
        "width": 84,
        "height": 80,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "ENTREPRENEURSHIP",
        "heading": "From Idea to Income",
        "body": "Idea → Prototype → Product → Customer\n\nAI lowers the cost of getting started.",
        "source": "Karpathy (2025), Software Is Changing (Again)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-6",
      "name": "Personal example",
      "space": {
        "x": 54,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 82,
        "height": 88,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "PERSONAL EXAMPLE",
        "heading": "My Tutoring Platform",
        "body": "A marketplace connecting students with student tutors.\n\nBuilt with AI-assisted coding.\n\nFrom a concept to a working prototype.",
        "source": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-7",
      "name": "Broader applications",
      "space": {
        "x": 46,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 86,
        "height": 90,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "BROADER APPLICATIONS",
        "heading": "You Don't Need to Start a Business",
        "body": "• Build your own study tools.\n• Automate repetitive tasks.\n• Create interactive portfolios.\n• Turn data into useful dashboards.\n\nSolve a problem that matters to you.",
        "source": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-8",
      "name": "The challenge",
      "space": {
        "x": 54,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 86,
        "height": 90,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "THE CHALLENGE",
        "heading": "Your First 30 Minutes",
        "body": "1. Identify a problem.\n2. Describe your idea to an AI coding assistant.\n3. Build, test, and improve your first prototype.\n\nYou don't need to know how to code to start learning.",
        "source": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rethink-ai-9",
      "name": "The call to action",
      "space": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": 50,
        "width": 86,
        "height": 88,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "content": {
        "label": "THE CALL TO ACTION",
        "heading": "Stop Just Using AI. Start Building.",
        "body": "One idea. One project. One week.\n\nThe question isn't what AI can do for you.\n\nIt's what you can create with it.",
        "source": ""
      }
    }
  ],
